            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बस सात वाजता येईल, तोपर्यंत आपण चहा घेऊ. bas sāt vājtā yeīl, toparyant āpaṇ cahā gheū. The bus will come at seven; until then, let us have tea."
            },
