          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तोपर्यंत (toparyant) is built from तो, \"that\", and -पर्यंत, \"up to\", from Sanskrit paryanta, \"limit, edge\" (Monier-Williams): up to that point."
